{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [],
  "annotations": {"list": []},
  "description": "Phase 8.7 — Claude Bedrock AI-Ops: invocations, decisions, health score, incident reports",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 100,
      "title": "🤖 Bedrock AI Layer",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "${CW_DS}"},
      "description": "Total Claude Bedrock model invocations from the closed-loop engine",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "blue",  "value": null},
              {"color": "green", "value": 1},
              {"color": "yellow","value": 50},
              {"color": "orange","value": 200}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 1},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["sum"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Bedrock Invocations (total)",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "Invocations",
          "dimensions": {
            "ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"
          },
          "expression": "",
          "highResolution": false,
          "id": "",
          "matchExact": true,
          "metricName": "Invocations",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "3600",
          "refId": "A",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Sum"]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "${CW_DS}"},
      "description": "Average Bedrock response latency (ms)",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green",  "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 2000},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 5000},
              {"color": "red",    "value": 10000}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 1},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Bedrock Latency (avg)",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "Latency ms",
          "dimensions": {
            "ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"
          },
          "metricName": "InvocationLatency",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "300",
          "refId": "A",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Average"]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "${CW_DS}"},
      "description": "Token usage: input + output tokens per invocation",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 1},
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["sum"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Tokens Used (total)",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "Input tokens",
          "dimensions": {"ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"},
          "metricName": "InputTokenCount",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "3600",
          "refId": "A",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Sum"]
        },
        {
          "alias": "Output tokens",
          "dimensions": {"ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"},
          "metricName": "OutputTokenCount",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "3600",
          "refId": "B",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Sum"]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "${CW_DS}"},
      "description": "Bedrock throttle / error events (should be 0)",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "green",  "value": null},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 1},
              {"color": "red",    "value": 5}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 1},
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["sum"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "title": "Bedrock Throttle Errors",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "Throttles",
          "dimensions": {"ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"},
          "metricName": "ThrottledRequests",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "3600",
          "refId": "A",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Sum"]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "id": 101,
      "title": "📊 AI Decision Timeline",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "${CW_DS}"},
      "description": "Bedrock invocations over time — shows AI activity cadence",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "Invocations/min",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {"legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false},
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"},
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "normal"},
            "thresholdsStyle": {"mode": "off"}
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 6},
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["sum", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "title": "AI Decision Timeline — Bedrock Invocations by Type",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "Anomaly Analysis",
          "dimensions": {"ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"},
          "metricName": "Invocations",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "60",
          "refId": "A",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Sum"]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "${CW_DS}"},
      "description": "Bedrock token consumption over time — cost proxy",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 6},
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["sum"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}
      },
      "title": "Token Usage Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "Input tokens",
          "dimensions": {"ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"},
          "metricName": "InputTokenCount",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "300",
          "refId": "A",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Sum"]
        },
        {
          "alias": "Output tokens",
          "dimensions": {"ModelId": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6"},
          "metricName": "OutputTokenCount",
          "namespace": "AWS/Bedrock",
          "period": "300",
          "refId": "B",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistics": ["Sum"]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14},
      "id": 102,
      "title": "🏥 Network Health Score",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
      "description": "Composite 0-100 network health score (derived from UPF CPU, anomaly score, capacity headroom)",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "mappings": [
            {"options": {"from": 90, "result": {"color": "green",  "index": 0, "text": "Excellent"}, "to": 100}, "type": "range"},
            {"options": {"from": 75, "result": {"color": "blue",   "index": 1, "text": "Good"      }, "to": 89 }, "type": "range"},
            {"options": {"from": 60, "result": {"color": "yellow", "index": 2, "text": "Fair"      }, "to": 74 }, "type": "range"},
            {"options": {"from": 40, "result": {"color": "orange", "index": 3, "text": "Poor"      }, "to": 59 }, "type": "range"},
            {"options": {"from": 0,  "result": {"color": "red",    "index": 4, "text": "Critical"  }, "to": 39 }, "type": "range"}
          ],
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red",    "value": null},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 40},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 60},
              {"color": "blue",   "value": 75},
              {"color": "green",  "value": 90}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 15},
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "minVizHeight": 75,
        "minVizWidth": 75,
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdLabels": true,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "text": {}
      },
      "title": "Overall Health Score",
      "type": "gauge",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "100 - (sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"upf.*\",container=\"upf\"}[1m])) * 100 * 1.2)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Health Score",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
      "description": "Per-slice health scores: eMBB, URLLC, mMTC",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red",    "value": null},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 40},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 60},
              {"color": "green",  "value": 80}
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "eMBB"},  "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "blue",   "mode": "fixed"}}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "URLLC"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "green",  "mode": "fixed"}}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "mMTC"},  "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "purple", "mode": "fixed"}}]}
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 15},
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "minVizHeight": 10,
        "minVizWidth": 0,
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "text": {}
      },
      "title": "Health Score by Network Slice",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "clamp_min(100 - (sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"upf.*\",container=\"upf\"}[1m])) * 100 * 0.72 + 0.0 * 0.28), 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "eMBB",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "clamp_min(100 - (sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"upf.*\",container=\"upf\"}[1m])) * 100 * 0.84 + 0.0 * 0.16), 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "URLLC",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "clamp_min(100 - (sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"amf.*\",container=\"amf\"}[1m])) * 100 * 0.5 + 0.0 * 0.5), 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "mMTC",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
      "description": "Health score time-series — shows network stability trends",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "scheme",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 4,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "red",    "value": null},
              {"color": "orange", "value": 40},
              {"color": "yellow", "value": 60},
              {"color": "green",  "value": 80}
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15},
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["min", "mean", "lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      },
      "title": "Network Health Score — Time Series",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "clamp(100 - (sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"upf.*\",container=\"upf\"}[1m])) * 100 * 1.2), 0, 100)",
          "legendFormat": "Overall",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "clamp(100 - (sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"upf.*\",container=\"upf\"}[1m])) * 100 * 0.72), 0, 100)",
          "legendFormat": "eMBB",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "clamp(100 - (sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"upf.*\",container=\"upf\"}[1m])) * 100 * 0.84), 0, 100)",
          "legendFormat": "URLLC",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23},
      "id": 103,
      "title": "🚨 Anomaly Events + AI Analysis",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
      "description": "UPF CPU% with anomaly threshold overlay — shows when Bedrock AI was triggered",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {"mode": "line+area"}
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {"color": "transparent", "value": null},
              {"color": "rgba(255,100,0,0.15)", "value": 60}
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "Anomaly Trigger (60%)"},
            "properties": [
              {"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed"}},
              {"id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": {"dash": [8, 4], "fill": "dash"}},
              {"id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 24},
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi"}
      },
      "title": "UPF CPU% with Bedrock Anomaly Trigger Threshold",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"open5gs\",pod=~\"upf.*\",container=\"upf\"}[1m])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "UPF CPU%",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "60",
          "legendFormat": "Anomaly Trigger (60%)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
      "description": "UPF replica count changes — shows auto-scaling triggered by AI decisions",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "stepAfter",
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 8,
            "showPoints": "always"
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 6,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 24},
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["min", "max", "lastNotNull"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "title": "UPF Replicas (AI-Driven Scaling)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
          "expr": "kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=\"open5gs\",deployment=\"upf\"}",
          "legendFormat": "UPF replicas",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32},
      "id": 104,
      "title": "📋 Latest AI Incident Report",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${PROM_DS}"},
      "description": "Latest network state from SageMaker classifier + Bedrock narrative. Check S3 for full reports.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33},
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## 🤖 Claude Bedrock AI-Ops — Phase 8.7\n\nAll AI-generated reports are saved to **S3**: `s3://5g-core-ml-models-749534910877/`\n\n| Report Type | S3 Prefix | Trigger |\n|---|---|---|\n| Incident Analysis | `incidents/` | anomaly_score > 0.6 |\n| Capacity Forecast | `capacity-forecasts/` | forecast > 150 UEs |\n| Predictive Alerts | `predictive-alerts/` | hourly |\n| Post-Incident PIR | `post-incident-reports/` | anomaly resolves |\n| Daily Summary | `daily-summaries/` | every 6 hours |\n\n**Check your email** (`nigelkadzinga91@gmail.com`) for SNS alerts on critical events.\n\n```bash\n# List latest reports\naws s3 ls s3://5g-core-ml-models-749534910877/incidents/ --recursive --human-readable | tail -5\naws s3 ls s3://5g-core-ml-models-749534910877/post-incident-reports/ --recursive --human-readable | tail -5\n\n# Read latest incident report\naws s3 cp $(aws s3 ls s3://5g-core-ml-models-749534910877/incidents/ --recursive | sort | tail -1 | awk '{print \"s3://5g-core-ml-models-749534910877/\"$4}') -\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "AI Reports Reference",
      "type": "text"
    }

  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "tags": ["5g-core", "bedrock", "ai-ops", "phase-8.7"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "name": "PROM_DS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus"
      },
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "name": "CW_DS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "cloudwatch",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "CloudWatch"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {"from": "now-3h", "to": "now"},
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "05 — Bedrock AI-Ops",
  "uid": "bedrock-aiops-01",
  "version": 1
}
